//    N=1000 synthetic substrate states (deterministic LCG seed=20260525).
//    Each state → 8-factor scores via spontaneous_lib → motivation_score.
//    Reports: mean score + PASS/FAIL vs 0.30 threshold.
//
//  CRITERION 4 — dream_stage Φ-envelope present + non-degenerate
//    All 5 ultradian stages: WAKE N1 N2 N3 REM.
//    dream_context(stage) → phi + tension_envelope for each.
//    Reports: per-stage Φ table + variance + PASS/FAIL.
//    Threshold: envelope present (no void/zero) + variance > 0.
